{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical-kona/items/224702/", "pk": 224702, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical-kona/", "pk": 34948, "shortname": "hawaiinautical-kona", "name": "Hawaii Nautical Big Island", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Kona Luxury Private Yacht Charter", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 9, "unicode": "Kona Luxury Private Yacht Charter", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 9.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 9.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 11000, "description": "*Maximum of 6 guests aboard makes for an uncrowded, intimate experience aboard a spacious and luxurious yacht.*\n \n\nCatering can be added for additional prices listed below.\n\n##Schedule\n\n5 hours\n\n9 a.m.-2 p.m. \n\n##About\nDolphin viewing, whale-watching in-season\n\nHawaii Nautical takes your private party of up to 6 guests on an unparalleled yacht to experience and exploration of the scenic Kona coastline. Snorkel, see dolphins and turtles year round. During whale season (December-April) also see humpback whales.  Custom itinerary where the captain presents the best snorkel options for the day, tailored to your wishes.\n\nThis five-hour charter can be extended by the hour to accommodate even more snorkel spots, sailing time, marine wildlife viewing, or any other preference for your private itinerary.\n\nADD A 6th HOUR to sail to Kealakekua Bay and snorkel Kealakekua’s underwater marine sanctuary, in view of the Captain Cook Monument (Note: approximately 3.5-4 hours of time on the Kealakekua trip would be spent underway).\n\nCabins for rest & rejuvenation and private changing areas, plus in-cabin restrooms and fresh-water showers for comfort and convenience.  Bring your snorkel and mask, or sanitized re-usable sets are available . Fins and snorkel vests are provided and in-water assistance from expert crew are included.  \n\n**Menu**\n**Catering and menu subject to change**\n\n\nFor all charters, catering is to be selected from the following options and is added on at the rate of a 4-plate minimum for guests 1-4, and is added at a per-person rate for all guests above the minimum. \n\nAl Fresco \n* Turkey club sandwich with fries, toasted white or wheat bread with turkey, bacon,\nlettuce, tomato and swiss cheese\n* OR Vegetarian option: Veggie burger with fries\nLocal Plate (add-on as purchase of 1 plate per person on any private charter)\n\nOR \n\nBelow (except vegetarian option) come with steamed rice and tossed salad:\n\n* Grilled Mahi Mahi\n* Grilled Salmon\n* Furikake crusted ono (wahoo) with aioli sauce\n* Spicy garlic chicken with aioli sauce\n* Pulehu shortribs (grilled beefed), seasoned with Hawaiian salt\n* Ribeye steak prepared with garlic salt and pepper, broiled and served with grilled\nmushrooms and onions\n* Vegetarian option: Veggie burger\n\nSalad dressings: ranch, French, thousand island, Italian, blue cheese, oriental or caesar", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#Aloha!\n#IMPORTANT REQUIRED STEP:  Separately you will receive an email for the waiver to be done by each individual in your party participating in a Hawaii Nautical/Port Waikiki Cruises activity. Parents/guardians also submit a form for each person 17 and under. Answer all questions, review health and safety precautions, and sign the waiver acknowledgment within one day of your scheduled activity.\n\nThank you for booking with Hawaii Nautical.  We look forward to seeing you soon!  If you have any questions please feel free to call us at 808-234-7245.\n\nMahalo!\n\nHawaii Nautical", "cancellation_notes": "If your tour is cancelled due to the captain’s discretion and/or weather, then you will receive a full refund or option to re-book your tour on another date based on availability.\n\nGuests cancelling their tour reservations 48 hours or more prior to departure are eligible to receive a full refund or can elect to re-book the tour on another date based on availability.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 20, "headline": "Private Luxury Yacht Charter • Customizable Kona Adventure", "short_description": null, "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kH2kd52TsyvfbLP0Owtj", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kH2kd52TsyvfbLP0Owtj", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical-kona/items/224702/images/1586169/", "pk": 1586169, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nezyoW6ET3SLGdJ4uWsy", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nezyoW6ET3SLGdJ4uWsy", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical-kona/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical-kona/items/224702/"}, "crop": {"x": 0, "y": 377, "width": 2560, "height": 1347, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/DEEhAFurQ5Gl0OiSIXiV"}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/DEEhAFurQ5Gl0OiSIXiV", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/DEEhAFurQ5Gl0OiSIXiV", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical-kona/items